{"type":"META","ticket":319,"id":"META"}||{"title":"LCSC_MAX98357AETE+T","tags":[],"source":"","images":[],"attributes":{"Symbol":"aa1a01f64e6e46dd","Footprint":"","Description":"微型、低成本、PCM 类 D 级放大器具有 AB 级性能","Name":"LCSC_MAX98357AETE+T","Designator":"U?","Value":"MAX98357AETE+T","Comment":"MAX98357AETE+T","MPN":"MAX98357AETE+T","Manufacturer":"ADI(亚德诺)/MAXIM(美信)","LCSC":"C910544","JLCPCB Part #":"C910544","Catalog_Status":"catalog_identity_verified; footprint_candidate_not_released","Catalog_URL":"https://item.szlcsc.com/978950.html","Design_Notes":"TQFN16+EP (logical EP17 must match chosen footprint). Floating GAIN gives9dB. SD_MODE driven through0R from AMP_ENABLE,10k pulldown; high selects LEFT channel, low shutdown. Firmware sends mono to left slot (or duplicate both); right-only audio is silent. SD_MODE selects channel/shutdown, NOT gain; gain is set by GAIN_SLOT. This is a deliberate default-off modification of old bias network. Speaker BTL neither wire GND. Keep clocks/data/enable LOW before +5V_SYS rises and before it falls; firmware sequencing validation required.","Footprint_Candidate_Status":"pending_not_selected","Assembly_Location":"PCB_OR_HARNESS_CANDIDATE","Add into BOM":"yes"}}|
