{"type":"ATTR","ticket":37,"id":"ie35"}||{"partId":"","groupId":"","locked":false,"zIndex":35,"parentId":"ie20","key":"Design_Notes","value":"TQFN16+EP (logical EP17 must match chosen footprint). Floating GAIN gives9dB. SD_MODE driven through0R from AMP_ENABLE,10k pulldown; high selects LEFT channel, low shutdown. Firmware sends mono to left slot (or duplicate both); right-only audio is silent. SD_MODE selects channel/shutdown, NOT gain; gain is set by GAIN_SLOT. This is a deliberate default-off modification of old bias network. Speaker BTL neither wire GND. Keep clocks/data/enable LOW before +5V_SYS rises and before it falls; firmware sequencing validation required.","keyVisible":false,"valueVisible":false,"x":325,"y":155.51181,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fillColor":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":5,"strikeout":false,"underline":false,"italic":false,"fontWeight":false,"align":"CENTER_MIDDLE"}|
