{"type":"ATTR","ticket":240,"id":"ie238"}||{"partId":"","groupId":"","locked":false,"zIndex":238,"parentId":"ie223","key":"Design_Notes","value":"Omron10pin0.5mm dual-contact FPC connector. Logical pin1..10 match TFT-H013A6QQIGC5N10 panel numbering; pin8 TE unused/NC. Cable contact side per panel front/display side, pin10 left/pin1 right in panel front view tail down. Dual-contact does NOT allow reversing numbered pin order. Tail0.30+/-0.05mm matches thickness; panelwidth5.5+/-0.1mm wider tolerance than connector5.5+/-0.05 recommendation, require sample fit/continuity. No old12pin or Waveshare8wire compatibility.","keyVisible":false,"valueVisible":false,"x":955,"y":675.51181,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fillColor":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":5,"strikeout":false,"underline":false,"italic":false,"fontWeight":false,"align":"CENTER_MIDDLE"}|
